# a package of its own (aZ, 18.11.2026: WebDAV as on his server with dav-ext):
# PROPFIND, OPTIONS, LOCK and UNLOCK, with the DAV module of nginx
# (www/nginx-devel-dav). The design and the source are in www/nginx-devel/Makefile.

